experiment-order-ame-name = Overloaded AME Telemetry
experiment-order-ame-desc = The corporation's power division requests readings from an AME running above its safe injection threshold. Scan an overloaded controller.

experiment-order-species-safe-name = Reagent Compatibility Check
experiment-order-species-safe-desc = A scan is needed of a { $species } subject carrying { $reagent } in their bloodstream. The data will help refine safe dosages for this species.

experiment-order-species-unsafe-name = Hazardous Reagent Field Test
experiment-order-species-unsafe-desc = A research grant requires scanning a { $species } subject with hazardous { $reagent } in their bloodstream. Do not forget a signed liability waiver.

experiment-order-vomit-name = Biological Fluid Analysis
experiment-order-vomit-desc = The janitorial service requested a scan of a vomit puddle's composition to pick more effective cleaning agents.

experiment-order-ripley-name = Fully Equipped Ripley Sample
experiment-order-ripley-desc = Supply is waiting for a Ripley mech with all three equipment slots filled. Scan a fully outfitted mech as proof.

experiment-order-pet-name = Station Pet Census
experiment-order-pet-desc = The corporation keeps a registry of station pets. Today's target to scan: { $target }.

experiment-order-xeno-name = Field Observation of Fauna
experiment-order-xeno-desc = The biology division needs a scan of a { $target } specimen. Try not to get hurt while collecting the data.

experiment-order-vending-name = Vending Machine Sales Data
experiment-order-vending-desc = The marketing division is collecting sales statistics. Scan a machine from the { $department } department ({ $target }), then rescan it after 10 minutes.

experiment-order-meat-name = Tasting Sample (Meat)
experiment-order-meat-desc = The kitchen needs scans of five meat dishes to refine their recipes. Any dish works, except the standard fried steak.

experiment-order-baton-name = Plasma-Filled Stun Baton
experiment-order-baton-desc = The security lab is studying how plasma affects energy carriers. A scan of a stun baton with at least 5u of plasma in its battery is required.

experiment-order-seed-name = Plant Genome Analysis
experiment-order-seed-desc = Botanists requested a genome scan of a mutated plant: { $target }.

experiment-order-radcollector-name = Radiation Collector Reading
experiment-order-radcollector-desc = The power division is gathering data on radiation collectors. Scan one operating under a load of at least 6 rad.

experiment-order-canister-gas-name = Gas Sample Analysis
experiment-order-canister-gas-desc = To verify a thermodynamic model, a scan of a canister holding at least 500 moles of { $gas } is needed.

experiment-order-captain-id-name = Captain ID Inventory
experiment-order-captain-id-desc = Cases of damaged captain's ID cards are on the rise. Scan a captain's card to confirm its authenticity.

experiment-order-weapon-name = Defective Weapon Search
experiment-order-weapon-desc = A batch of defective weapons may have reached the station. Scan one of: { $target } to check whether it was affected.

experiment-order-paper-signatures-name = Signature Database Update
experiment-order-paper-signatures-desc = HR is updating its personnel database. Submit a scan of a document signed by at least five different people.

experiment-order-bible-name = Holy Book Scan
experiment-order-bible-desc = The department archive requires a scan of any holy book.

experiment-order-fruit-dishes-name = Tasting Sample (Fruit)
experiment-order-fruit-dishes-desc = The kitchen is hunting for the most vitamin-rich fruit dish. Prepare and scan five fruit dishes.

experiment-order-soups-name = Tasting Sample (Soups)
experiment-order-soups-desc = The kitchen needs scans of five soups to refresh the menu. Provide a sample of five dishes.

experiment-order-gravity-name = Gravity Field Check
experiment-order-gravity-desc = A scan of a functional and active gravity generator is required for the report.

experiment-order-combat-mech-name = Combat Mech Sample
experiment-order-combat-mech-desc = Security requested proof of a fully equipped combat mech { $target } with all equipment slots filled. Scan the outfitted mech.

experiment-order-material-name = Material Reference Scan
experiment-order-material-desc = The production division requested a reference scan of a material of category: { $target }.

experiment-scanner-perform = Perform Scan
experiment-scanner-processing = Processing...

